Vaishravana Yama Mahendra Varuna Mahadeva and Brahma come in sunlike vimanas to Raghava --- Gods with vast jewelled arms ask creator best of knowers why overlook Sita falling in fire and self best of gods --- Gods call him Vasu Prajapati maker of three worlds Rudra Sadhya Ashvin-eared sun-moon-eyed yet acting like low human --- Raghava lord of worlds answers he thinks himself human Rama son of Dasharatha asking who and whence he is --- Brahma bids truthful mighty Rama hear he is Narayana discus-armed lord single-tusked boar foe-conqueror --- Brahma calls him imperishable Brahman supreme dharma Vishvaksena four-armed Sharnga-bowed Hrishikesha Purusha Purushottama Ajita Vishnu Krishna --- Brahma calls him leader intellect patience origin dissolution Upendra Madhusudana lotus-navel battle-ender and refuge of seers --- Brahma calls him thousand-horned Veda-self sacrifice vashat omkara unknown origin seen in beings brahmins cows quarters sky mountains forests --- Brahma says he bears beings and mountain earth as serpent in waters with Brahma his heart Sarasvati tongue gods in hairs night wink day opening and world his body --- Brahma says fire his anger moon favour Srivatsa mark strode three worlds bound Bali made Mahendra king --- Brahma says Sita is Lakshmi he Vishnu Krishna Prajapati entered human body to kill Ravana and task done ascend pleased heaven with unfailing strength and devotees